{
  "schema": "agent-custom/v1",
  "description": "agent 系列个性化配置（两层默认：供应商层与 agent 层相互独立，agent 层优先）。供应商层：providers.<途径>.default_models/default_strengths.<agent>；agent 层：agents.<agent>.provider/model/strength。生效规则：存在用户编写的 agent-custom.json 时完全替代本文件，否则以本文件为个性化默认值；两文件均与 agent-config.json 深度合并（同名键个性化优先）。",
  "guidance": [
    "复制本文件为 agent-custom.json 后按需修改；agent-custom.json 已被 .gitignore 忽略，不会入库。",
    "两层默认相互独立、agent 层优先：解析顺序为 命令行/环境变量 > agents.<agent>.model|strength > providers.<途径>.default_models|default_strengths.<agent>。",
    "agents.<agent>.model/strength 留空（或省略）时取当前途径的默认值与默认强度；填写后作为该 agent 的固定默认，不随供应商快捷词（cl go / op gpt / co pay）切换而变化。",
    "模型强度（strength）统一配置：cl 经 CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL、op 经 variant、co 经 reasoning effort 落地，三条解析链相同。",
    "agents.<agent>.provider 决定未指定快捷词时使用哪个途径；切换途径后若 agents.<agent>.model/strength 留空，即使用该途径的 default_models/default_strengths。",
    "agents.opencode.provider 仅决定「未指定模型时用哪个途径的默认模型」；opencode 实际注册的途径仍是 agent-config.json agents.opencode.key_providers 中 key 已设置者。",
    "agents.claude.env 只保留 claude 专属附加项（HAIKU/子代理模型/压缩窗口等）；ANTHROPIC_MODEL 与 OPUS/SONNET 别名、CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL 由上述解析链自动派生。",
    "agents.opencode.secure_binary 为 HPC/secure 变体（cls/ops/cos）下 opencode 的部署路径（升级 vscode-server 后会变化）。"
  ],
  "providers": {
    "deepseek-pay": {
      "default_models": {
        "claude": "deepseek-flash[1m]",
        "opencode": "deepseek/deepseek-flash",
        "codex": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "default_strengths": {
        "claude": "max",
        "opencode": "max",
        "codex": "max"
      }
    },
    "opencode-go": {
      "default_models": {
        "claude": "deepseek-v4.1-flash",
        "opencode": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash",
        "codex": "deepseek-v4.1-flash"
      },
      "default_strengths": {
        "claude": "max",
        "opencode": "max",
        "codex": "max"
      }
    },
    "custom-gpt": {
      "default_models": {
        "opencode": "custom-gpt/gpt-6-astra",
        "codex": "gpt-6-astra"
      },
      "default_strengths": {
        "opencode": "max",
        "codex": "max"
      }
    }
  },
  "agents": {
    "claude": {
      "provider": "deepseek-pay",
      "model": "",
      "strength": "",
      "env": {
        "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL": "deepseek-flash",
        "CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL": "deepseek-flash"
      }
    },
    "opencode": {
      "provider": "deepseek-pay",
      "model": "",
      "strength": "",
      "secure_binary": "/public/home/zhangxin/.vscode-server./cli/servers/Stable-4fe60c8b1cdac1c4c174f2fb180d0d758272d713/server/node/Stable-4fe60c8b1cdac1c4c174f2fb180d0d758272d713/server/out/debug_Stable-4fe60c8b1cdac1c4c174f2fb180d0d758272d713/result_debug_Stable-4fe60c8b1cdac1c4c174f2fb180d0d758272d713/output_result_debug_Stable-4fe60c8b1cdac1c4c174f2fb180d0d758272d713"
    },
    "codex": {
      "provider": "custom-gpt",
      "model": "",
      "strength": ""
    }
  }
}
